<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19059" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fūnĕrĕus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		funus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a funeral</i>, <i>funeral</i>- (<b>poet.</b> for the
			class. funebris, q. v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faces,</span>”
				<i>funeral-torches</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 11, 143</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fronde coronat pyram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 506</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>deadly</i>, <i>destructive</i>, <i>fatal</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					8, 511</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dextra (Discordiae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 7, 468</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bubo,</span>”
				i. e. <i>ill-boding</i>, <i>dismal</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 453</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os bubonis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib.
					226</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
